      "writtenOn": "2026-08-05T07:17:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I moved this block to the end to check all component versions for deduplication first. However, I agree with you—an early return; in the loop would make the entire FD vanish if parsing fails.  To fix this while keeping the deduplication, I plan to change the return; to a break; in the next patchset. This way, if parsing fails, it will safely fall back to creating the image-level entry at the bottom.Let me know if this approach sounds good to you!",
